## Validation

Validated on 5 participants (tape measure ground truth):

| Measurement | Target | Result |
|---|---|---|
| Chest | ±3 cm | — |
| Waist | ±3 cm | — |
| Height | ±2 cm | — |
| Size accuracy | ≥80% | — |

*Results table will be filled after in-person validation (Week 3).*

