## Garment support (v1)

| Type | Sizes | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| Men's kurta | XS–3XL | Chest / waist primary |
| Women's kurta / anarkali | XS–3XL | Chest / waist / hip |
| Saree blouse | 28–44 | Chest primary |

Lehenga, sherwani → post-v1.

